@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<h1>BrainHarbor</h1>
<p>
    Brain tumor research, explained in plain language. We are building this
    site now. It is not ready to use yet.
</p>

<h2>What this site will do</h2>
<p>
    Every day, new brain tumor research comes out. Most of it is hard to read.
    BrainHarbor will collect it in one place and explain it in words that make
    sense.
</p>
<ul>
    <li>A daily feed of new research, news, and clinical trials.</li>
    <li>Plain-language summaries, checked by a person before they go up.</li>
    <li>Clear labels that say how far along each piece of research is.</li>
</ul>
<p>
    You can read more about brain tumors today at the
    <a href="https://www.cancer.gov/types/brain">National Cancer Institute</a>.
</p>
